{"version":1,"key":"card:204","content":{"id":204,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"cloneNode","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法从名字可以看出，该方法是将自己克隆一份，并返回。复制后的节点归文档所有，但是没有为该节点指定父节点。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"该方法接收一个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"bool","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 类型的参数，当传入为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"false","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 时，表示的是浅复制，当传入的参数为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"true","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 时，表示的是深复制。浅复制只会复制当前节点，不会复制该节点的子节点，而深复制不仅会复制当前节点，并且会复制当前节点下面的子节点。举一个例子，假设有这个一个 HTML 结构"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"<ul>\n  <li></li>\n  <li></li>\n  <li></li>\n</ul>","language":"HTML","uuid":"45e776e0-949b-4ec6-bfff-8d44e47b040d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当我们对 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"ul","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 进行复制，如果是浅复制"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"let newUl = ul.cloneNode(false);","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"a0e69bc7-76c0-4ad2-8b5b-ba6bf5af2fe2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"那么 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"newUl","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 为"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"<ul></ul>","language":"HTML","uuid":"cb026106-288f-44aa-8edb-ac5995b8c112","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"里面没有任何的内容，但是如果是深复制的话，则会将其子节点(以及子节点的子节点)也复制过来"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"let newUl = ul.cloneNode(true);","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"ce4db029-5565-41a3-86b6-448f8d644924","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这时 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"newUl","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 为"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"<ul>\n  <li></li>\n  <li></li>\n  <li></li>\n</ul>","lan